# Teensy 4.1 Drivers

Hardware driver modules for the **Teensy 4.1**, developed using **PlatformIO and Arduino**.

Each driver is implemented as a separate module and includes its own tests using the **Unity testing framework**.

### Build

```bash
pio run
```

### Upload

```bash
pio run -t upload
```

### Run Tests

```bash
pio test
```

Run a specific driver test:

```bash
pio test -f <test_name>
```
